=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The Venn diagram corresponding to this situation is as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-339413411d5963c35c0a0406169832de\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/339413411d5963c35c0a0406169832de\"></div>\n</div></div>",
