etchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.5</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>To check our answer, we can construct the corresponding Venn diagram:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-87130-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-87130-e-0\"></div>\n</div></div>",
